					<div class="tool__out" aria-live="polite" data-out="match"></div>
				</div>
				<p class="fine tool__note">
					Take-home means what reaches your pocket after the mortgage, expenses, and anything you pay a manager. This comparison buys with cash and no new
					loan. The rates shown are examples for the calculator, not what you will earn.
				</p>
